message: "If you use FutureOS in research, teaching, or a derived project, please cite this software."
title: "FutureOS: A versioned decision operating system"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Dresden"
    website: "https://github.com/DresdenGman"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-08-30
url: "https://futureos.space"
repository-code: "https://github.com/DresdenGman/futureos"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - decision science
  - probabilistic forecasting
  - calibration
  - Brier score
  - Bayesian updating
  - expected utility
abstract: >-
  FutureOS preserves what a person believed before an outcome was known,
  records evidence-linked probability updates, and resolves forecasts so
  judgment can be evaluated over time.
